---
// SAFETY-CRITICAL. This page will attract people in distress, so crisis
// resources sit high on the page rather than only in the footer. The brief
// treats this as non-negotiable for a dual-diagnosis page.
---
<section class="bg-navy text-white py-9">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-5 md:gap-8">

      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 flex-1">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12z"/>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p class="font-body font-bold text-white text-[17px] mb-1">If you are in crisis right now, please start here</p>
          <p class="font-body text-white/80 text-[16px] leading-[26px]">
            Admission to treatment takes a little time to arrange, and a crisis needs help immediately. Call or text
            <a href="tel:988" class="text-gold font-semibold hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity tel-number underline underline-offset-2"> 988</a>
            to reach the Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline, any hour of any day. If someone is in immediate danger, call 911.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="tel:988" class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white hover:bg-cream text-navy font-semibold h-12 px-7 rounded-lg transition-colors font-body">
        <span class="tel-number">Call or text 988</span>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
